@format 1
@id merge.remove-group
@title Remove merge group
@area Merge
@entry input
@summary Remove one complete merge group from the current Merge tab.
@flow TB
@related merge.remove-file

@alias group = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PGroup

[input] Group removal requested <input>
- Receive the remove command for a group card @ group.PGroupRemove(...)
> remove

[remove] Remove group <process>
- Remove the group record and rebuild the visible group list @ group.PGroupRemove(...)
> result

[result] Group removed <output>
= No future merge work is created for the removed group.
